  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "NanoKnow-Fineweb-Edu-Index",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tNanoKnow FineWeb-Edu Lucene Index\n\t\n\n[Paper] [Code]\nA pre-built Lucene BM25 index over karpathy/fineweb-edu-100b-shuffle\u2014the exact pre-training corpus used by the nanochat family of language models. Built with Anserini.\nThis index is part of the NanoKnow project: github.com/castorini/NanoKnow\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tIndex Details\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nProperty\nValue\n\n\n\t\t\nCorpus\nkarpathy/fineweb-edu-100b-shuffle\n\n\nDocuments\n97,230,848\n\n\nIndex Size\n~325 GB (extracted)\n\n\nIndex Type\nLucene (BM25)\n\n\nBuilt With\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/castorini/NanoKnow-Fineweb-Edu-Index.",
